1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,575
Day 1 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,403
Yesterday, Leo was
all alone…

3
00:00:04,403 --> 00:00:05,507
…and then you
showed up!

4
00:00:05,847 --> 00:00:07,563
Yesterday: 1 resident.

5
00:00:07,563 --> 00:00:08,187
Today? 10!

6
00:00:08,527 --> 00:00:11,764
That brings
€9,072 into the budget!

7
00:00:12,104 --> 00:00:14,829
Ecaterina, Orbit and Kalina
move in with Leo!

8
00:00:14,829 --> 00:00:16,043
His house is full!

9
00:00:16,383 --> 00:00:18,482
Joshua asked for
a separate house…

10
00:00:18,482 --> 00:00:19,177
Here it is!

11
00:00:19,517 --> 00:00:21,436
2 of you wanted
an apartment block…

12
00:00:21,436 --> 00:00:23,117
Room for 120 more!

13
00:00:23,457 --> 00:00:25,556
Yoan, Gabor and 2 more
move in!

14
00:00:25,896 --> 00:00:27,072
And what do you
want next?

15
00:00:27,072 --> 00:00:29,092
School and police station
are tied!

16
00:00:29,432 --> 00:00:32,019
The school costs
€120,000.

17
00:00:32,019 --> 00:00:34,058
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

18
00:00:34,398 --> 00:00:36,185
Who wants to be
the first principal?

19
00:00:36,185 --> 00:00:37,402
Tell me in the
comments!
